  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your Nines. Since they are 'Aged' at the start of the game, they are guaranteed points. Don't play them early unless you need to seize control to play a long sequence.\n\nAged-Card Tracking: If the 9 of Coins has been played, the 8 of Coins becomes the 'Old Card'. Track this perfectly to know when your medium-value cards have become 'unstoppable tigers'.\n\nThe Vul-Play: If you have 4 'Fu' already in hand (e.g., three Nines and an Ace), declare 'Play'. Even if you only win two more tricks, you achieve the target. However, if your hand is weak, don't declareâ€”let someone else take the risk.",
    Player: "Keep your Nines. Since they are 'Aged' at the start of the game, they are guaranteed points. Don't play them early unless you need to seize control to play a long sequence.\n\nAged-Card Tracking: If the 9 of Coins has been played, the 8 of Coins becomes the 'Old Card'. Track this perfectly to know when your medium-value cards have become 'unstoppable tigers'.\n\nThe Vul-Play: If you have 4 'Fu' already in hand (e.g., three Nines and an Ace), declare 'Play'. Even if you only win two more tricks, you achieve the target. However, if your hand is weak, don't declareâ€”let someone else take the risk.",
